Yeh Kis Shaheed Ki Mayyat Hussain Laate Hain<br>
zamee'n Larazti Hai Aflaak Thar Tharate Hain<br>
<br>
1. Padi Hain Bikhri Huvi Tan Pe Sehre Ki Ladiya'n<br>
<br>
yeh Phool Zaqmou'n Ke Tan Pe Sajaye Aate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Khadi Hai Dar Pa Jo Maa Peet-ti Huvi Sar Ko<br>
<br>
dikhaye'n Laashe Ko Kaise Yeh Soche Jaate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Lipat Ke Laate Hain Chadar Ke Goshe Me Rakh Kar<br>
<br>
sarou'n Pe Khaak Baraati Sabhi Udhate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Dulhan Na Aaye Kahin Shor-e-girya Ko Sunkar<br>
<br>
toh Baar Baar Abaa Me Ise Chupate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Yeh Kaisi Laash Hai Baandhi Huvi Hai Gathri Me<br>
<br>
bata Rahe Hain Kisi Ko Kabhi Chupate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Uthake Laate Hain Shabbir Laash Dulha Ki<br>
<br>
laraz Raha Hai Badan Pau'n Thar Tharate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Khade Hain Khaime Ke Dar Par Jo Aake Ahl-e-har<br>
<br>
baraat Dekh Ke Dulha Ki Rote Jaate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Macha Hai Khaimou'n Me Kohraam Haaye Qasim Ka<br>
<br>
hussain Laash Se Chadar Ko Ab Hatate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
9. Le Aayi Laash Pe Baazu Ko Thaam Kar Madar<br>
<br>
dulhan Ko Dulha Ka Deedaar Ab Karate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
10. Sajaye The Abhi Sandal Se Maang Haaye Ghazab<br>
<br>
usi Ko Bewa Ka Ab Pairahan Pinhate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
11. Saroun Pe Khaak Udhao Mujaab Peeto Sar<br>
<br>
yeh Aisa Gham Hai Ke Is Gham Me Khoo'n Bahate Hain